NAME =    resources
GARNAME = resources
GARVERSION = 	51.beta
HOME_URL = http://www.gnome.org/
DESCRIPTION = system resources display
define BLURB
Resources is a simple yet powerful monitor for your system resources
and processes, written in Rust and using GTK 4. Display usage and
details of your CPU, memory, GPUs, NPUs, network interfaces and block
devices. Listing and terminating running graphical applications as well
as processes.  It aims to strike a balance between information richness,
user-friendliness and a balanced user interface -- showing you most of
the information most of you need most of the time.
endef

######################################################################

